assert r.lin > 0</code>

and

<code>assert r.exp > 0</code>

The second assert statement is a redundant one since `self.exp` in the `__init__` method is also equal to `n`, so it always remains positive. Therefore, it's unnecessary to assert `n > 0` on this case.
